 ('Research-led','The clearest path from your goal to what you get, your plan and payment.','Lead candidate','MadMuscles; BetterMe profile','Personal recap, program before price, monthly default, repeated renewal and CTA.','Abs By AI product proof in a calm, sequential layout.','Easy to understand; the payment decision sits farther down on mobile.'),
 ('HBI adaptation','A strong offer selector, numbered stages and reassurance beside the form.','Challenger','HBI healthandwellnesstools.com','Prominent free offer, blue selected row, numbered stages, value column, yellow action, unchecked agreement.','Digital membership replaces bottles and shipping. Both options remain subscriptions.','Recognizable direct-response structure; denser form and an extra agreement step.'),
 ('Program-first','Explore a first-week outline and see what membership puts in your hands.','Creative direction','MadMuscles program contents; BetterMe recap','A tangible program and a personal starting point.','Interactive week guide, real app screen and a stable order panel.','Makes the product concrete; longer mobile journey before payment.'),
