 cards+=f'''<article class="concept"><a href="{slug}.html" class="concept-preview" aria-label="Open {name}"><img src="screenshots/{i:02}-mobile.jpg" alt="Mobile screenshot of {name}"></a><div class="concept-content"><span class="concept-number">0{i} / {n[0].upper()}</span><h2>{name}</h2><p>{n[1]}</p><span class="tag">{n[2]}</span><div class="links"><a href="{slug}.html">Interactive ↗</a><a href="screenshots/{i:02}-mobile.jpg" target="_blank">Mobile</a><a href="screenshots/{i:02}-desktop.jpg" target="_blank">Desktop</a><a href="screenshots/{i:02}-payment.jpg" target="_blank">Payment</a><a href="screenshots/{i:02}-success.jpg" target="_blank">Success</a><a href="screenshots/{i:02}-declined.jpg" target="_blank">Declined</a></div></div></article>'''
